    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">The minimum-change table is already computed. At index <var>v</var>, <var>lastCoin</var> contains the value of the last coin chosen for amount <var>v</var>, or <const>-1</const> if it is impossible.<br><br>Starting at <var>amount</var>, take that coin and subtract its value. Repeat until <const>0</const>. Print the coins in this traversal order, <const>IMPOSSIBLE</const> for impossible change, or <const>NONE</const> for amount <const>0</const>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> Two integers <var>amount</var> and <var>n</var>, the change amount and table size.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> <var>n</var> space-separated integers <var>lastCoin</var>, indexed from <const>0</const> to <var>n</var> &minus; <const>1</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>One line:</strong> The coin values in traversal order, separated by spaces, or <const>IMPOSSIBLE</const> or <const>NONE</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; <var>n</var> &le; 101<br>0 &le; <var>amount</var> &lt; <var>n</var><br><var>lastCoin</var>[0] = 0<br>For <const>1</const> &le; <var>v</var> &lt; <var>n</var>, the entry is <const>-1</const> or a coin value from <const>1</const> to <var>v</var>.<br>The table is guaranteed to describe minimum-coin solutions. Each positive entry leads to a reachable remainder.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">6 7\n0 1 1 3 4 1 3</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">3 3</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
